\b Iro 0.3\b0\par
Your Fujifilm recipe library.\par\par
This preview manages local recipes, simulated slots and USB reads of X-E5 custom banks. Recipe values are not written to the camera. Bank reads temporarily select each bank and restore the original selector. Unknown values are preserved without guessing. Camera recipe writes and DAT modification are not implemented.\par\par
This application is independent and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Fujifilm. Fujifilm and camera model names belong to their respective owners.\par\par
Uninstalling the application preserves your recipe library in your user profile.\par
